msgstr "正在下载发布升级工具"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:83
msgid ""
"If using the latest supported release, upgrade to the development release"
msgstr "如果使用最新的支持版本，则升级到开发版本"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:90 ../check_new_release_gtk.py:188
msgid ""
"Try upgrading to the latest release using the upgrader from $distro-proposed"
msgstr "尝试通过 $distro-proposed 更新到最新版本。"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:94
msgid ""
"Run in a special upgrade mode.\n"
"Currently 'desktop' for regular upgrades of a desktop system and 'server' "
"for server systems are supported."
msgstr ""
"以特定模式升级。\n"
"目前支持：用“desktop”为桌面系统，“server”为服务器系统升级。"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:103
msgid ""
"Check only if a new distribution release is available and report the result "
"via the exit code"
msgstr "仅在有新的发行版发布时检查，并通过退出码(exit code)报告结果"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:108
msgid ""
"Try the upgrade with third party mirrors and repositories enabled instead of "
"commenting them out."
msgstr "请尝试在启用第三方镜像和仓库的情况下更新，而不是将他们注释掉。"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:114
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of environment variables (e.g. "
"VAR1=VALUE1,VAR2=VALUE2) that should be set during the upgrade."
msgstr "升级过程中使用的环境变量应以逗号进行分隔（例如：VAR1=VALUE1,VAR2=VALUE2）。"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:126
msgid "The options --devel-release and --proposed are"
msgstr "--devel-release 与 --proposed 选项"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:127
msgid "mutually exclusive. Please use only one of them."
msgstr "不相容，请只用其中的一个选项。"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:131
msgid "Checking for a new Ubuntu release"
msgstr "正在检查新版 Ubuntu"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:143
msgid "Your Ubuntu release is not supported anymore."
msgstr "不再提供您的 Ubuntu 版本的支持。"

#: ../do-release-upgrade:144
msgid ""
"For upgrade information, please visit:\n"
"%(url)s\n"
msgstr ""
"要获得关于升级的信息，请访问：\n"
"%(url)s\n"

